    fix(test): harden flaky console-raw retry/serialization test (FLK-1)
    
    Replace wall-clock assumptions in test_console_raw_retry_path_is_bounded_and_game_access_is_serialized
    with deterministic synchronization: bounded 20ms-poll admission wait (asserts <=3 workers on every
    sample), event-driven gate waiting for an observed 'server busy' rejection before releasing the
    fake Game (drain-race), and bounded 2s poll for worker exit after server.close(). All original
    invariants kept (bounded worker set, max_active==1, busy rejection, all responses received).
    
    Failed once on CI run 37489146871; passes 10/10 consecutive locally after fix.
    
